{
  "name": "CETE Hosts Telemedicine Workshop Bridging Bedside to Webside Care",
  "parent_id": 203313741962379,
  "group_id": "b12ab77c-64de-4feb-817b-aa3685fc0b8f",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:42:41.565Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:58.274Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:58.261Z",
  "id": 203986377005744,
  "uuid": "8d8ad4d2-8177-4dc1-8ddf-3e7b69d37c63",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d2ae85b9-d525-06c3-ca77-d728a425568b",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "ddf18913-6f7c-0624-6d23-8de07d6ca51e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "With telemedicine increasingly becoming a cornerstone of modern healthcare, the workshop aimed to equip medical professionals with the skills required to deliver high-quality virtual care. Recognizing the evolving importance of telemedicine, especially in emergency situations, the workshop sought to bridge the gap between traditional bedside care and remote consultations.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Through interactive sessions led by esteemed faculty from Weill Cornell Emergency Medicine, participants delved into the fundamentals of telemedicine, including video-based history taking, conducting remote physical exams, and fostering advanced communication skills vital for building rapport with patients in virtual settings.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The workshop was led by distinguished faculty members from Weill Cornell Emergency Medicine:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "ordered_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Peter Greenwald, M.D. (Vice Chair Clinical Strategy and Innovation).",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Neel Naik, M.D. (Director of Emergency Medicine Simulation Education).",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Kristie A. Busch, D.O. (Assistant Professor of Clinical Emergency Medicine).",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As telemedicine continues to reshape healthcare delivery, CETE remains committed to advancing telemedicine education and innovation. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
