    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a groundbreaking initiative to harness the power of telemedicine in emergency care, the Centre of Excellence for Trauma and Emergencies (CETE) at Aga Khan University hosted its inaugural ACCME Accredited telemedicine workshop, titled \"From Bedside to Webside: Use of Telemedicine in Emergency Care.\"",
